  "mapLive": true,
  "_about": "Eclipse cluster: a horizontal three-band composition, not the Aurum/Apex side columns. The header band carries navigation, the ECLIPSE wordmark with the drive mode, and now playing; the hero is one dark eclipse disc with an amber/ice corona, a huge speed and gear, with the four tyres floating left and the G-meter right; the console band across the bottom carries fuel and range, the shift data, the 0-60 timer, boost and intake, average speed and the best G. Theme decorations, holiday lights and the DEMO tag come from the engine; no oil, coolant, torque or power readouts. Full screen: clock, range and outside temperature along the bottom. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
